Subject: [PATCH] realtek: update PCS and phylink provider interfaces

Bring the PCS provider and internal phylink handling in line with the
local OpenWrt reference required by the updated Realtek drivers. Keep
the adaptation in the Realtek 6.18 stack.

Based on OpenWrt commit 5799d2da76998be50432b0a3325b42713b4b619b,
including the PCS provider backports by Christian Marangi.

Signed-off-by: lean <chenlin@fnnas.com>

